- bei halben Portionen aufrunden.</td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder1">1..1</td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder1"><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-integer">integer</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder1">Enable When: <span><a href="#item.DH3">DH3</a> = Täglich oder mehrmals täglich (AT PreNUDGE ATHIS Answer Options#diet-daily-or-more)</span></td></tr>
